  "description": "Shared contracts for CQRSharp: the command, query, stream and notification markers and base types, handler interfaces, CommandResult, the pipeline and validation attribute contracts, exception hooks, and the store and unit-of-work contracts (CQRSharp.Persistence). Reference it directly from a project that only shares contracts or implements a store; a project that declares handlers references the CQRSharp meta-package, whose source generator registers them. Carries the CQRSharp analyzers, which reach every project that references a CQRSharp package.",
